{"id":"dotman-nln","title":"Integrate hooks into dotman CLI deploy command","description":"Currently the hooks functionality (pre_deploy and post_deploy) is fully implemented but not wired into the deploy command. This epic adds hook execution to the CLI so users can run shell commands before/after package deployment.","status":"tombstone","priority":2,"issue_type":"epic","owner":"nimitbhardwaj@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:40.419684+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj","updated_at":"2026-01-18T17:55:39.098747+05:30","labels":["feature","ralph"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dotman-nln","depends_on_id":"dotman-65t","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:34:04.834392+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj"}],"deleted_at":"2026-01-18T17:55:39.098747+05:30","deleted_by":"daemon","delete_reason":"delete","original_type":"epic"}
{"id":"dotman-nln.1","title":"US-001: Add HookExecutor import and initialization in deploy command","description":"As a dotman user, I want hooks to run during deployment so that my shell commands execute automatically.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] Import HookExecutor from dotman.hook_executor in cli.py\\n- [ ] Create HookExecutor instance in the deploy command with dry_run parameter\\n- [ ] HookExecutor is created alongside LinkManager, TemplateEngine, and HistoryManager\\n- [ ] ruff check passes\\n- [ ] ruff format passes\\n- [ ] mypy passes\\n- [ ] pytest passes","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"nimitbhardwaj@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:47.624092+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj","updated_at":"2026-01-18T17:39:14.780929+05:30","closed_at":"2026-01-18T17:39:14.780929+05:30","close_reason":"Completed by agent","labels":["ralph","task"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dotman-nln.1","depends_on_id":"dotman-nln","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:47.625416+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj"}]}
{"id":"dotman-nln.2","title":"US-002: Execute pre_deploy hooks before file deployment","description":"As a dotman user, I want pre_deploy hooks to run before my files are deployed so that I can prepare the environment.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] For each package, execute pre_deploy hooks before processing files\\n- [ ] Pass package variables, dotfiles_dir, and target_dir to hook executor\\n- [ ] Display hook commands being executed in console output\\n- [ ] Abort deployment if pre_deploy hook fails (stop processing this package)\\n- [ ] ruff check passes\\n- [ ] ruff format passes\\n- [ ] mypy passes\\n- [ ] pytest passes","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"nimitbhardwaj@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:49.726449+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj","updated_at":"2026-01-18T17:43:38.186087+05:30","closed_at":"2026-01-18T17:43:38.186087+05:30","close_reason":"Completed by agent","labels":["ralph","task"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dotman-nln.2","depends_on_id":"dotman-nln","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:49.727102+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj"},{"issue_id":"dotman-nln.2","depends_on_id":"dotman-nln.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:55.926048+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj"}]}
{"id":"dotman-nln.3","title":"US-003: Execute post_deploy hooks after file deployment","description":"As a dotman user, I want post_deploy hooks to run after my files are deployed so that I can complete setup tasks.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] For each package, execute post_deploy hooks after processing all files\\n- [ ] Pass package variables, dotfiles_dir, and target_dir to hook executor\\n- [ ] Display hook commands being executed in console output\\n- [ ] Continue deployment even if post_deploy hook fails (log error but don't abort)\\n- [ ] ruff check passes\\n- [ ] ruff format passes\\n- [ ] mypy passes\\n- [ ] pytest passes","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"nimitbhardwaj@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:52.159963+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj","updated_at":"2026-01-18T17:46:20.977032+05:30","closed_at":"2026-01-18T17:46:20.977032+05:30","close_reason":"Completed by agent","labels":["ralph","task"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dotman-nln.3","depends_on_id":"dotman-nln","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:52.161042+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj"},{"issue_id":"dotman-nln.3","depends_on_id":"dotman-nln.2","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-01-18T17:33:55.992356+05:30","created_by":"Nimit Bhardwaj"}]}
